---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: 森田 圭祐 | メモ帳
description: 森田圭祐のメモ帳。研究、技術、日々の考察を記録しています。
currentPage: blog
---

<main id="top">
  <section class="blog-index" aria-labelledby="articles-title">
    <div class="blog-index-heading">
      <p class="section-index">ARTICLES</p>
      <h2 id="articles-title">記事一覧</h2>
    </div>

    {% if collections.blogCategories.length %}
      <nav class="category-navigation" aria-label="カテゴリ別の記事一覧">
        <span>カテゴリ</span>
        <ul>
          {% for category in collections.blogCategories %}
            <li>
              <a href="{{ category.name | categoryUrl }}">
                {{ category.name }} <span aria-label="{{ category.posts.length }}件">({{ category.posts.length }})</span>
              </a>
            </li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </nav>
    {% endif %}

    {% if collections.blogPosts.length %}
      <ol class="blog-list">
        {% for post in collections.blogPosts %}
          <li>
            <article class="blog-card">
              <div class="blog-card-meta">
                <time datetime="{{ post.date | htmlDateString }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
                {% if post.data.categories %}
                  <ul class="category-tags" aria-label="メモのカテゴリ">
                    {% for category in post.data.categories %}
                      <li><a href="{{ category | categoryUrl }}">{{ category }}</a></li>
                    {% endfor %}
                  </ul>
                {% endif %}
              </div>
              <h3><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.postTitle }}</a></h3>
              {% if post.data.description %}<p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>{% endif %}
            </article>
          </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ol>
    {% else %}
      <p class="blog-empty">メモはまだありません。</p>
    {% endif %}
  </section>
</main>
